Closing Remarks from doctor conner:  From recent research and developments that have been made about SCP-5234, it appears that SCP-5234 does not only retain the form of a shower curtain but; also possess shapeshifting abilities which are currently unusable at this time. In addition, SCP-5234 has shown complete sentience beyond previous thought, as well as the ability to communicate through radio signals when within range (10m) of any radios without fear of SCP-5234’s anomaly’s ability. Though communication can still be hard to decipher. SCP-5234 has expressed several hostile concerns about returning home.5 SCP-5234 had also clarified that it posses several other anomalies effects that are not able to be used because it remains here on earth. And or lacks the nutrients to perform said anomalies effects. It is presumed this is why SCP-5234 needs to consume stuff such as flesh, blood, and other essential parts of the human body, not only to replicate human parts to blend in and continue to feed easier, but also to gain enough nutrients to be able to communicate back to its homeworld. The means on how SCP-5234 would do this are unknown, and SCP-5234 refuses to comment any further on this matter. SCP-5234 on the other hand does still retain most of its anomalies properties listed above. However, it appears that when SCP-5234 consumes a certain amount of human matter, it will lose some of its previous anomalies properties such as its hypnotic whispers. Forcing SCP-5234 to blend in and attack from up close. The only known way of recovering its whisper is by suffering from starvation and returning to a containable size.

The origins of SCP-5234’s form and appearance have also been explained by SCP-5234 itself. They state that because of an internal and protective instinct, when SCP-5234 had landed in Champagne Illinois. They had promptly landed in the bathroom of a local townhouse, shapeshifting into the first thing they had seen. Which had been the shower curtain. The reasons above state why SCP-5234 isn’t able to shift forms and report back to what it refers to as its “Home world.”

It is also currently unknown if there remains more than one SCP-5234 on a different planet or if this is just a plan for SCP-5234 to be released. This theory is still undergoing research, and staff is still unsure if plans should be made to prevent the invasion of more than one SCP-5234. Right now SCP-5234 had informed researchers that if let go, “The earth will be spared when the ultimate annihilation has come.”

SCP-5234 is to remain in their cell and away from all human life unless research or new developments have been made, as to prevent the growth of SCP-5234 and the possible event of a cataclysmic breach.

This info is to be kept from any researcher that is below level 4. Failure to do so will result in immediate on-site termination. 






